'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch01-button-led.spin2
''   Purpose....  A pin read and a pin driven, with no smart pin involved
''                - the baseline everything later is measured against
''   Manual.....  P2 I/O & Smart Pins User Guide
''   Version....  v1.0.9 (2026-08-18)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 1: Direct I/O - The Foundation -- 1.11 Common
''                Patterns
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Jun 2026
''   Updated....  Jun 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

CON
  _clkfreq = 200_000_000
  BUTTON_PIN = 10
  LED_PIN = 56

PUB main()
  repeat
    if PINREAD(BUTTON_PIN) == 0       ' Active-low button
      PINHIGH(LED_PIN)
    else
      PINLOW(LED_PIN)

